Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootful jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken cellular iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the rootful layout and supports iOS 12 or newer.
 .
 Beta 3 adds receiver audio, hardware-aware HD video, responsive touch,
 lifecycle recovery, a Showcase vehicle app, and BTstack compatibility checks.
